From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:03:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix px per-point opacity array being misapplied when traces
 are split

When opacity is given as an array, store it as a hidden column of the
internal dataframe so it is grouped and reordered together with the
data, and give each trace only its own slice in marker.opacity.

Closes #4580
---
 CHANGELOG.md                           |  1 +
 plotly/express/_core.py                | 42 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/test_optional/test_px/test_px.py | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 86 insertions(+)

